        },
        {
          "title": "Compass: North-Up vs Track-Up",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>The <strong>Compass</strong> sits in the upper-left corner. Single-press it to switch between <strong>North Up</strong> (north stays at the top) and <strong>Track Up</strong> (the map turns with your heading, keeping the Self-Marker facing forward).</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/f62653e74f549bb8.webp",
              "width": 142,
              "height": 86
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Rotate the map by hand",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Long-press the <strong>Compass</strong> and select <strong>Manual Orientation</strong>, then drag two fingers on the map to spin it to any bearing you like.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/385e94853490e4e1.webp",
              "width": 229,
              "height": 84
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Lock the map rotation",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>To freeze the map at its current angle, long-press the <strong>Compass</strong> and tap <strong>Manual Orientation</strong> again. The padlock icon confirms the orientation is locked; tap once more to unlock.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/1751fe73910cdd76.webp",
              "width": 152,
              "height": 56
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Switch screen orientation",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Select <strong>Orientation</strong> to swap the screen between landscape and portrait, independent of how you are holding the device. Changing it closes any open drop-downs so they redraw correctly.</p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/5498c3e67f68b52a.webp",
              "width": 170,
              "height": 336
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Adjust brightness for day or night",
          "layout": "image-bottom",
          "html": "<p>Select <strong>Brightness</strong> and use the slider to dim or brighten the map for daylight or low-light use. Only the map dims; markers and drop-downs stay fully visible.</p>\n<p>After seeing Basic view, toolbar, tools, continue to <a href=\"/doc/6bf5c875-5082-4f7c-b28c-26b5eea8b0c5\">Blue force tracking</a></p>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/fc88141492e86a6f.webp",
              "width": 1275,
              "height": 199
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
